Subject: [PATCH 11/11] venus: opaque Win32 (NT handle) memory export and import on D3DKMT

Exposes VK_KHR_external_memory_win32 with OPAQUE_WIN32 handles on the
D3DKMT renderer and filters the guest-only extension from the host device:
- shareable blob allocations are created with CreateShared and
  NtSecuritySharing, and keep their resource handle for export and teardown;
- vkGetMemoryWin32HandleKHR duplicates the D3DKMTShareObjects handle,
  honouring access, security attributes, inheritance and names;
- NT and named imports query private-data sizes, open the resource with
  D3DKMTOpenResourceFromNtHandle and pass the handle straight to D3DKMT;
- a private pNext (yttrium_memory_runtime_data_info) carries runtime private
  data to D3DKMTCreateAllocation, used by the vkd3d-proton shared-resource
  path.
Needed for D3D12 shared resources through vkd3d-proton.

Prior art: F69-F71 (R/NATIVE-WDDM20.md; V/EXPERIMENTS.md lines 402-416; prior-art section 1).
Origin: codex working tree R/mesa (git diff 374c3022), re-exported by
vmlab-win3d build/mesa; see build/mesa/README.md.
